# 🍉 Fruit Ninja Game

### 🎮 What it does

Fruits appear on screen and player slices them.

### 🕹️ How to play

* Swipe (or drag mouse) across fruits
* Slice fruits to gain points
* Avoid bombs

### ⚙️ Core Logic

* Spawn fruits randomly from bottom
* Apply upward movement + gravity (they fall down)
* Detect swipe collision with fruit
* If sliced → increase score + play animation
* If bomb is sliced → game over
* Missed fruits (optional penalty)
* Speed increases over time

