# 🏗️ Tower Building Game (Animals / Objects)

### 🎮 What it does

Player stacks animals or objects to build a tall tower.

### 🕹️ How to play

* Object moves left and right at top
* Tap to drop it
* Stack carefully without falling

### ⚙️ Core Logic

* Moving object system (left ↔ right loop)
* Drop on click/tap
* Physics check (balance / alignment)
* If placed well → stable
* If misaligned → object tilts/falls
* Tower height = score
* Game over when tower collapses

