# 🐍 Snake Game (Multiplayer)

### 🎮 What it does

Snake eats food, grows longer, and competes with others.

### 🕹️ How to play

* Control snake direction
* Eat food to grow
* Avoid hitting walls or yourself
* Can eat smaller snakes

---

## ⚙️ Core Logic (Single Player)

* Grid-based movement system
* Snake moves every tick (time interval)
* Food spawns randomly
* If snake eats food:

  * Increase length
  * Increase score
* Collision detection:

  * Wall → game over
  * Self → game over

---

## 🌐 Multiplayer Logic

### Real-time system needed

* Each player has:

  * Position
  * Direction
  * Length

---

### Game Loop

* Server updates all snakes
* Broadcast positions to all players

---

### Player Interaction

* If snake head hits another snake:

  * Bigger snake wins
  * Smaller snake dies

---

### Online Features

* Room system (join game)
* Leaderboard (live ranking)
* Respawn system (optional)

---

### 🤖 Bot System

* AI snakes move automatically
* Find nearest food
* Avoid collisions

---

# 🔥 Summary

* Fruit Ninja → swipe + collision + physics
* Tower Game → drop + balance + stacking
* Snake Game → grid + growth + multiplayer

